 gan at the New Moon of Oct 10 comes full circle. Reread the intention you 
 wrote: what has blossomed? what do you release? what do you adjust?\n\n—
  new moon: a fresh path opens\nThis New Moon in Libra lands in your house 
 of beliefs\, studies and long journeys — both the Sun and Moon meet here
 \, making this a strong moment to plant seeds for how you want to grow and
  expand your horizons. Venus\, ruler of this Moon\, sits naturally in your
  home and roots house but is currently transiting the same area as this Mo
 on\, retrograde — asking you to revisit a value or belief before moving 
 forward\, rather than rushing into something new. Mercury nearby\, trine y
 our natal Jupiter\, brings mental clarity and optimism to support this int
 ention-setting.\n\nConsider: 'I commit to exploring one belief or idea tha
 t stretches how I see the world\,' 'I commit to researching a course\, tri
 p or path that expands my horizons\,' or 'I commit to noticing where old v
 alues no longer fit before deciding my next step.' You'll revisit this int
 ention at the Full Moon in Libra on March 22\, 2027. → Choose one intent
 ion and write it somewhere you'll see it again.\n\n—\n✨ A product crea
